<title>FRANCE: Trichet says lira ERM pivot rate a good rate.</title>
<headline>Trichet says lira ERM pivot rate a good rate.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of France governor Jean-Claude Trichet said in an interview published on Monday that the rate at which the lira rejoined the European Exchange Rate Mechanism was a good rate.</p>
<p>&quot;As regards Italy, the Bank of France is pleased with the good solution which was found for the lira's pivot rate on its return to the European Exchange Rate Mechanism,&quot; Trichet said in an interview with afternoon daily Le Monde.</p>
<p>&quot;It's a good rate which has been ratified by the markets,&quot; Trichet said.</p>
</text>
